# Data — snapshots and trial registry are local artifacts, not source (D24, D20)
/data/snapshots/
# D608: everything under data/raw/ is a gitignored cache except its README, which states the
# cache contract. `/data/raw/*` + a negation, because a directory rule cannot be re-included.
/data/raw/*
!/data/raw/README.md
# SqueezeMetrics DIX/GEX (docs/research/licences/squeezemetrics-dix-gex.md): no redistribution, including in public
# repositories, of the data or lightly transformed versions; the public cut ships every tracked file, so no
# DIX/GEX-derived per-date file may ever be tracked.
**/*dix*.csv*
**/*gex*.csv*
**/*dix*.parquet
**/*gex*.parquet
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
trial_registry.csv

